'' RUN: 'this' as the operand of a user binary or unary operator is the object it points at,
'' byref and byval. Check asks ThisArgType_ (symbols/check.tiko) and lowering passes the
'' pointer's value or loads the object (OperandValue_, mir/lowerswap.tiko). Output identical
'' to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/this-operand.bas -o tests/codegen/thisoperand.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/thisoperand.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/thisoperand.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  15
